  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWith the 4th path (or 3rd depending on where you start counting) of the JSON file linked below I'm getting some issues when using Revolve Looping in combination with the Fitted Path Type. It causes the camera to do a 360 at every path marker that I created.\n\nThis does not happen with any other configuration.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Import the camera path JSON\n\n2. Set Looping to Revolve\n\n3. Set Path Type to Fitted\n\n3. Wait for the 4th path to play or set streaming to multi\n\nIf you do this you should notice the 4th path behaving weirdly, setting Looping / Path Type to anything but Revolve solves the problem.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nRevolve Looping in combination with the Fitted Path Type should not cause these problems.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is the camera path as well as a video showcasing the behaviour:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/QXSOtdZRfBg",
